    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a bridge between curiosity and problem-solving—I love its precision and how it connects abstract ideas to real-world logic. Though challenging at times, the structure makes it rewarding, especially when breaking down complex problems step-by-step. It’s both daunting and stimulating, much like climbing a mountain; you never know where it’ll take you next.",
