    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Not formally, but my relationship app’s learning platform sometimes integrates interactive math quizzes. Though limited, it felt helpful for quick reviews—especially during my physics studies. The low extraversion score meant I wasn’t keen on group discussions over these tools, but the personal feedback was useful.",
